      "content": "OAuth 2.0 authorization server and OpenID Connect provider that authenticates and identifies verified Doximity medical professionals against the Doximity medical database. Uses the Authorization Code grant with mandatory PKCE (S256), refresh tokens, and the device_code grant.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Doximity Business Development\n Email: bd@doximity.com",
